es\",\"description\":\"Our AI selects the best data sources for your specific query. Local businesses → Google Maps. Company profiles → social API. Job signals → job boards. Each query is routed to where the data actually lives.\",\"detail\":\"Sources selected per query type. You never have to choose, Origami knows where to look.\"},{\"number\":\"03\",\"title\":\"AI agents search live, in real time\",\"description\":\"Not a database query. Actual search agents running against live sources, the same sources a human researcher would use, just 100× faster. Results reflect what's true today, not 6 months ago.\",\"detail\":\"Typical search time: 45-90 seconds. Slower than a database lookup, but the data is actually current.\"},{\"number\":\"04\",\"title\":\"Results are enriched and verified\",\"description\":\"Raw search results are enriched with contact data, tech stack, funding info, and buying signals, then verified before returning to you. No phantom emails, no closed companies.\",\"detail\":\"Email verification: SMTP handshake. Company verification: cross-referenced across 3+ sources.\"}],\"mockup\":{\"prompt\":\"Find dental practices in Miami-Dade County with 4.5+ star rating and at least 50 Google reviews\",\"columns\":[{\"key\":\"practice\",\"label\":\"Practice\"},{\"key\":\"owner\",\"label\":\"Owner / DDS\"},{\"key\":\"phone\",\"label\":\"Phone\",\"accent\":true},{\"key\":\"rating\",\"label\":\"Rating\"},{\"key\":\"reviews\",\"label\":\"Reviews\"},{\"key\":\"source\",\"label\":\"Data Source\"}],\"rows\":[{\"practice\":\"Brickell Dental Group\",\"owner\":\"Dr. Maria Santos\",\"phone\":\"+1 (305) 555-0182\",\"rating\":\"4.9 ★\",\"reviews\":\"312\",\"source\":\"Google Maps, live\"},{\"practice\":\"Coral Gables Smiles\",\"owner\":\"Dr. James Rowe\",\"phone\":\"+1 (305) 555-0734\",\"rating\":\"4.7 ★\",\"reviews\":\"189\",\"source\":\"Google Maps, live\"},{\"practice\":\"Miami Beach Dentistry\",\"owner\":\"Dr. Chen Li\",\"phone\":\"+1 (305) 555-0291\",\"rating\":\"4.8 ★\",\"reviews\":\"241\",\"source\":\"Google Maps, live\"},{\"practice\":\"Doral Family Dental\",\"owner\":\"Dr. Ana Hernandez\",\"phone\":\"+1 (786) 555-0415\",\"rating\":\"4.6 ★\",\"reviews\":\"98\",\"source\":\"Google Maps, live\"},{\"practice\":\"Kendall Dental Arts\",\"owner\":\"Dr. Michael Torres\",\"phone\":\"+1 (305) 555-0867\",\"rating\":\"4.9 ★\",\"reviews\":\"167\",\"source\":\"Google Maps, live\"}],\"resultCount\":394},\"featureSectionLabel\":\"[02] Why real-time data wins\",\"featureTitle\":\"Database records go stale. The web doesn't.\",\"features\":[{\"title\":\"Companies that don't exist in any database\",\"description\":\"32M+ local businesses are missing from traditional databases and have no Crunchbase profile. The only way to find them is to search Google Maps, which is exactly what Origami does.\"},{\"title\":\"Signals that require recency to be useful\",\"description\":\"A funding round from 2022 isn't a buying signal. A funding round from last week is. Origami's signals are fresh because they come from live sources.\"},{\"title\":\"No data decay on your results\",\"description\":\"Database records for a 200-person company might show 50 employees because the record was captured 3 years ago. Live search returns what's true today.\"},{\"title\":\"Contact data that's actually current\",\"description\":\"People change jobs. Email addresses stop working. Origami verifies contact data at the time of enrichment, not when a database was last batch-updated.\"}]}],null,\"$L20\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"21:[]\n13:\"$W21\"\n14:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L22\",null,{\"children\":\"$L23\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L24\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$25\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$L26\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$25\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\